description:
HONEY! Fresh off her new single “ROCKSTAR,” global drag icon and musical artist @pabllovittar is opening her YouTube Watch History for the very first time! 

She takes us on an unfiltered tour of what she is watching, revealing the videos that inspire everything from her upcoming album “LOST IN LUST” to her KILLER QUEEN moves in Fortnite. From stanning BLACKPINK, to true crime deep dives with Jaqueline Guerreiro, to incredible drag beauty secrets from Plastique Tiara, Pabllo’s Watch HIstory is EVERYTHING. Plus, Pabllo opens up about the power of Brazilian drag culture and reflects on her iconic performance with her “mama” Madonna. 

